  "solution": {
    "text": "The fusion reaction is as given below:<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>H</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></math><br /><br />The binding energy of the reacting nuclei<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1.1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1.1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4.4</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br /><br />The binding energy of the product nuclei<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>7.0</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>28.0</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br /><br />Hence, the energy released in the fusion reaction,<br /><br /><math><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28.0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4.4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>23.6</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi></math> ."
  }
